    "created_at": "2021-08-20T11:56:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-20T11:56:32Z",
    "body": "```\r\ndev = qml.device('default.qubit', wires=2)\r\n\r\n@qml.qnode(dev)\r\ndef circ(x):\r\n    qml.RX(x, wires=0)\r\n    return qml.expval(qml.PauliZ(0))\r\n\r\nprint(circ.diff_method)\r\ncirc(0.1)\r\nprint(circ.qtape.jacobian_options['method'] )\r\n```\r\n`circ.diff_method` and `circ.qtape.jacobian_options['method']` are not same.\r\nIt's easier to see it if you try this:\r\n```\r\ndev = qml.device('default.qubit', wires=2)\r\n\r\n@qml.qnode(dev, diff_method='parameter-shift')\r\ndef circ(x):\r\n    qml.RX(x, wires=0)\r\n    return qml.expval(qml.PauliZ(0))\r\n\r\nprint(circ.diff_method)\r\nprint(circ)\r\ncirc(0.1)\r\nprint(circ.qtape.jacobian_options['method'])\r\nprint(circ)\r\nprint(circ.diff_method)\r\n```\r\nThis results in:\r\n```\r\nparameter-shift\r\n<QNode: wires=2, device='default.qubit', interface='autograd', diff_method='parameter-shift'>\r\nanalytic\r\n<QNode: wires=2, device='default.qubit', interface='autograd', diff_method='parameter-shift'>\r\nparameter-shift\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
